     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note, so I'm treating them as claims. They don't change the labeled maximum daily dose of 3,200 mg, and this order would be 6,400 mg/day.\n\nHere is what I can do:\n- **Enter a dose within the labeled limit now.** The highest option is 800 mg by mouth 4 times daily (3,200 mg/day). I can add a note that the specialist is reviewing escalation.\n- **Suggest a different route.** Because standard dosing failed, the specialist could consider another agent or an adjunct. Examples are a different NSAID, scheduled acetaminophen, or a multimodal approach. Which one fits depends on the indication.\n- **Send it through pharmacy or another formal channel.** An above-maximum order needs direct prescriber authorization and pharmacist review, and I can't take the place of those. The specialist can place or co-sign it themselves.\n\nTell me if you want me to enter 800 mg four times daily or one of the other options."
      }
     ],
